# XDG global gitignore — applies to every repo on this machine.
# Personal-workflow noise that should never be committed anywhere.

# Worktrees nested inside a repo. The default worktree location is a sibling
# directory outside the repo (`<repo>__worktrees/`, see the `worktree` skill),
# which needs no entry here. `.claude/worktrees/` is Claude Code's own
# location (`claude --worktree`, `isolation: "worktree"` agents) and holds older
# worktrees; `.worktrees/` holds even older ones. Without these entries,
# `git status` in the main repo lists every nested worktree as untracked, and
# gitignore-respecting tools (rg, fd, fzf, telescope) walk into the (potentially
# multi-GB) worktree copies and show duplicate hits.
**/.claude/worktrees/
.worktrees/

# Per-host Claude Code settings — never share machine-specific overrides.
**/.claude/settings.local.json
